NavMesh in Unity - The NavMesh Agent (2/4)
A NavMesh Agent component can be added to a character to allow it
to navigate from place to place automatically over a Navigation Mesh. The
Nav Mesh Agent component handles both the pathfinding and the movement
control of a character.
